         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Did you find time to talk to my mother?",
         "transl": "Hast du mit meiner Mutter geredet?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[nickt]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "She was not always like this. ",
         "transl": "Sie war nicht immer so..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "When my younger brother disappeared into the depths of the bamboo thickets, she became that way...\\.\\.\\. over time.",
         "transl": "Als mein jüngerer Bruder eines Tages in den Bambuswäldern verschwand, wurde sie mit der Zeit...\\.\\.\\. so."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Why?",
         "transl": "Чому?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NERVOUS"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "She never gave up the search and after a while... she started talking in riddles.",
         "transl": "Sie hat die Suche nach ihm nie aufgegeben... Und nach einer Weile fing sie dann an, nur noch in Rätseln zu sprechen."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "At one point she even claimed my brother returned as \"the protector of the ridge\". ",
         "transl": "Irgendwann sprach sie sogar davon, dass mein Bruder als \"der Beschützer des Grats\" zurückgekehrt sei."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "I think this loss was just too hard on her.",
         "transl": "Ich glaube, der Verlust war einfach zuviel für sie."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
